cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use QuDPy-FDGF in published work, please cite it using the metadata below, and the article that describes it (see README.md)."
type: software
title: "QuDPy-FDGF: a Python-based tool for computing ultrafast nonlinear optical responses using frequency-domain Green's functions"
abstract: "Open-source Python framework that evaluates Liouville-space pathways of finite quantum systems with unitary or Markovian GKSL dynamics as chains of time propagators and frequency-domain Green's functions, with polarization, action-detected and photon-count observables."
